      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FRITH IN FLIGHT (1) drew wide when she chased a good filly last start and came from the back row to win at Wagga prior. Should get every chance form the ace draw. DEL LICIOUS (4) resumes after seconds behind the good fillies Birdsong and Shes a Delaney in her two outings of the maiden campaign. Last seen in March but should have matured since then and she has been readied with a trial win here. SWINGING QUEEN (8) showed good improvement when runner-up in a heat of this series last start at Newcastle. Has to contend with a wide draw but she'll be fitter again third up and the last time she raced here she won the rich APG Final. KVITKA STRIDE (7) has been no match for Group 1 winner Birdsong in her last two outings here but has boxed on for second. Draws wider but can be competitive against these. GUNNAREASON (3) wasn't far behind KVITKA STRIDE when placed last time and draws well again.",
